HST Office: a new .docm lists its macros in word/vbaData.xml.

Word's Macros dialog names what vbaData.xml names, not what the project holds. The owner's test in real
Word: Word's own project in a package without the part lists nothing; HST's project in Word's package
does not list its own macro. Public Subs without parameters are written, outside Option Private Module,
as Word writes them.

